<title>USA: CS First Boston unit files for $800 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>CS First Boston unit files for $800 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston Mortgage Securities Corp, an affiliate of CS First Boston Corp, said Friday it filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $800 million in conduit mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
</text>
